      "section": "论华盖",
      "text": "渊海子平卷一",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c037:p0001",
      "sha256": "a5b823f6ea5176cb26de398b4c34c75d5a8a162220ac6a0c9e33ec836fae8376"
    },
    {
      "section": "论华盖",
      "text": "论华盖",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c037:p0002",
      "sha256": "d817c09df253b753b293d63eb8c35c54014a6863cc833f2044128ce8cc22653c"
    },
    {
      "section": "论华盖",
      "text": "寅午戌见戌，巳酉丑见丑，申子辰见辰，亥卯未见未。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c037:p0003",
      "sha256": "d3eae5197a969ae38460e295b7a326c81828dcbe67dbec5a227cc5b88431ee6c"
    },
    {
      "section": "论华盖",
      "text": "华盖本为吉，凡人命中得之，多主孤寡，纵贵亦不免为孤独也，遇之多为僧道术论。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c037:p0004",
      "sha256": "9301c91df35d2239ac93a1c82eb977819eb50cdc9fcb07b16c414a4e3a9db548"
    },
    {
      "section": "论华盖",
      "text": "《壶中子》云：华盖为艺术之星，主孤。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c037:p0005",
      "sha256": "e50e038bdfb698237f367212ae6c894132d5bd2f644a909bd1ec62a45ac21ad6"
    },
    {
      "section": "论华盖",
      "text": "眉批：此星如盖立乎大帝之旁。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
        {
